# Options → "Stock Exchange ticker shows". Switches the LED boards to price and ₡ change, then
# to change %, then to following the change pills (the default): a click on any pill turns the
# boards between % and price and ₡ change too. Logs today's entries in each mode and captures
# the screen (point the camera at the Stock Exchange to see the boards). The player's choice
# and the list's pills are put back at the end.
name ticker shows: change %, price and ₡ change, or as the change pills show it
live-ticker on
ticker-shows price
expect-log ticker PriceAndChange: 
# the whole screen is redrawn in the new style at once (never a mix)
wait 1
expect-ticker-style
wait 25
capture ticker-price
ticker-shows percent
expect-log ticker ChangePercent: 
wait 1
expect-ticker-style
wait 25
capture ticker-percent
# following the pills: % while they show %, price and ₡ once they show points
investments-sort sync off
investments-sort Change
ticker-shows pills
expect-log ticker ChangePercent: 
wait 1
expect-ticker-style
investments-sort Change currency
ticker-shows pills
expect-log ticker PriceAndChange: 
wait 1
expect-ticker-style
wait 25
capture ticker-pills-points
cleanup:
ticker-shows restore
